      "html": "<p>A customized course for the professional or student of esthetics. This course will teach you how to perform a microdermabrasion treatment in an excellent and safe way.<br>These skills can then be applied within the medical aesthetics or cosmetic medical fields in an aesthetics spa, medi- spa, or medical clinic.<br>Students receive certification with a successful completion.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Some of the theory subject areas you can expect to cover in class:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Exfoliation.</li><li>Understanding Skin rejuvenation.</li><li>Effects, benefits, and contra-indications.</li><li>Customizing treatments.</li><li>Maintenance &amp; home care.</li><li>Aftercare treatment</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Course duration: 2 days / Total 8 hours</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p>PRICE: <strong></strong></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"/images/library/Microderma-Planning.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3786\" srcset=\"/images/library/Microderma-Planning.jpeg 1000w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microderma-Planning-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microderma-Planning-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microderma-Planning-600x400.jpeg 600w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microderma-Planning-120x80.jpeg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter has-custom-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background\">Check Out Our Academy Courses Catalogue</a></div>\n</div>"
