      "imageAlt": "Waxing / Hair Removal Course",
      "excerpt": "LEVEL 1: WAXING\n\n\n\nBeginner/no previous experience needed. Training material provided by Crownora Barber Academy\n\n\n\nHow to protect yourself and the customerThe different ways to prevent i...",
      "html": "<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"level-1-waxing\">LEVEL 1: WAXING</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><br><em>Beginner/no previous experience needed. Training material provided by Crownora Barber Academy</em></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>How to protect yourself and the customer</li><li>The different ways to prevent infection and contamination</li><li>Health and safety using equipment Type of infections</li><li>Anatomy of the hair- structure, hair type, growth phase factors</li><li>Preparation for waxing- consultation, contraindications</li><li>Pathology(skin/body diseases and disorders) – name the most common</li><li>Pre and post waxing recommendation Preparation of the skin</li><li>Therapist professional appearance and communication</li><li>Consultation and contraindication The five senses experience</li><li>Customer comfort ( towel placement, client modesty, removal of jewelry etc.)</li><li>Difference between strip &amp; hot wax- application &amp; removal</li><li>Wax application &amp; removal- arm wax, leg wax &amp; underarm wax ( theory and practical )</li><li>After care &amp; home care recommendation (practical)</li><li>RRR – Retail referral and rebook</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p><br><strong>KHDA &#8211; Pakistan DIPLOMA<br>45 HOURS | In-class</strong> theory &amp; practical 30 hours &amp; Internship 15 hours. PRICE: <strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"level-2-waxing\">LEVEL 2: WAXING</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><br><em>Previous experience needed. Training material provided by Crownora Barber Academy</em></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Consultation and contraindication</li><li>Therapist professional appearance and communication</li><li>The five senses experience</li><li>Customer comfort ( towel placement, client modesty, removal of jewelry, etc.)</li><li>Preparation of the skin</li><li>Wax application &amp; removal- nose wax, ear wax, eyebrow shape, Brazillian wax ( theory and practical )</li><li>Aftercare &amp; home care recommendation RRR – Retail referral and rebook</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p><br><strong>KHDA &#8211; Pakistan DIPLOMA<br></strong>25 HOURS | In-class theory &amp; practical 15 hours &amp; Internship 10 hours. PRICE: <strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter has-custom-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background\">Check Out Our Academy Courses Catalogue</a></div>\n</div>"
