      "excerpt": "Get Long and Elegant Nails with Nails Extension\n\n\n\nHands are one of the first things that are noticed in a person upon meeting them first. Research indicates that hands are the...",
      "html": "<p><strong><u>Get Long and Elegant Nails with Nails Extension</u></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Hands are one of the first things that are noticed in a person upon meeting them first. Research indicates that hands are the best or true judge of a person’s character. Moreover, nails also reveal a lot about the person. Chewed-up, jagged, and short nails reveal stressed or nervous character. Similarly, long fingernails but dirt underneath is a sure shot sign of poor hygiene. Conversely, well-manicured and clean nails tells about the care taken by a person about his or her appearance. People who love sporting long nails but their fail to grow properly, choosing <strong>nail extension </strong>is the best option. If you are looking forward to flaunt your lovely long nails, achieve the same look with different types of <strong>nail extension</strong>s.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Nail Extension Courses</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Many people also take up <strong>nails courses in Pakistan </strong>and help people get lovely hands and nails. As part of this course, they learn using different types of <strong>nail extension. </strong>Here are a few of them.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Acrylic Nail Extension</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>It is one of the most popularly used nail extensions and is a blend of acrylic powder and liquid. These two elements are mixed properly to create a paste which is brushed over the nail. It gets hardened in some time. It is very durable and looks nature, hence a preferred choice among users.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Fiberglass Nail Extension</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>As part of <strong>nails courses in Pakistan, </strong>you will learn how to use fiberglass nail extension. The major benefit of using this option is its light weight. These are thinner extensions but are highly resilient. They provide required strength necessary in nail extensions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Gel Nail Extension</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Another nail extension option that is taught in nail extension course is gel material, a traditional&nbsp; option. In this type of nail extension, coloured gel piece is moulded and fitted to the tip of the nail. Visit Crownora Barber Academy and check out nail technician courses and their contents to see which course is best suited to your career goals.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Nordic INTL. Beauty and Training Centre offers a wide selection of nail courses customized to fit every individual’s needs including Nails Extension,&nbsp;whether you are interested in learning for personal gain or to become a certified nail technician. We offer Nails Course In Pakistan and welcome everyone at Crownora Barber Academy academy, independent of their previous knowledge or skill. We work with award-winning and internationally certified educators that will carry out pre-assessment tests to be able to determine the most suitable course or program for you. We can also individually customize a private course tailormade to your needs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our wide variety of nail courses:<br><em>Basic / Spa Manicure &amp; Pedicure | Drill Machine Nail<br>Extensions | Acrylic/Gel | Poly Gel Nail Extensions<br>Russian Manicure &amp; Pedicure | Nail Art</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\"><strong><a href=\"/courses/manicure-courses\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.nordicbtc.ae/courses/manicure-courses/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MANICURE COURSES</a></strong></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"/courses/manicure-courses\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/library/manicure-pic1-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3812\" width=\"404\" height=\"404\" srcset=\"/images/library/manicure-pic1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/manicure-pic1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/manicure-pic1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/manicure-pic1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/manicure-pic1-600x600.jpg 600w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/manicure-pic1-120x120.jpg 120w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/manicure-pic1.jpg 1079w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 404px) 100vw, 404px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong><a href=\"/courses/nail-technician-courses\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.nordicbtc.ae/courses/nail-technician-courses/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">NAIL TECHNICIAN COURSES</a></strong></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"/courses/nail-technician-courses\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/library/nailart-pic-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3813\" width=\"406\" height=\"406\" srcset=\"/images/library/nailart-pic-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/nailart-pic-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/nailart-pic-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/nailart-pic-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/nailart-pic-600x600.jpg 600w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/nailart-pic-120x120.jpg 120w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/nailart-pic.jpg 1079w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 406px) 100vw, 406px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"/courses/drill-machine-courses\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.nordicbtc.ae/courses/drill-machine-courses/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DRILL MACHINE COURSES</a></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"/courses/drill-machine-courses\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/library/drill-pedicure-pic1-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3814\" width=\"409\" height=\"409\" srcset=\"/images/library/drill-pedicure-pic1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/drill-pedicure-pic1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/drill-pedicure-pic1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/drill-pedicure-pic1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/drill-pedicure-pic1-600x600.jpg 600w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/drill-pedicure-pic1-120x120.jpg 120w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/drill-pedicure-pic1.jpg 1079w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 409px) 100vw, 409px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter has-custom-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background\">Check Out Our Academy Courses Catalogue</a></div>\n</div>"
