      "html": "<p>Duration: 2 Full days – 10am &#8211; 6pm<br>( Including 𝟮 𝗺𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗵𝘀 𝗳𝗼𝗹𝗹𝗼𝘄 𝘂𝗽 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗹𝗶𝘃𝗲 𝘁𝗿𝗮𝗶𝗻𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗼𝗻 𝗮 𝗺𝗼𝗱𝗲𝗹 )<br><br>Price;  without kit<br>Price;  including kit</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Certificates; KHDA &amp; The Crownora Barber Academy Certificate</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Deposit fees are  ( 50% ) and the full amount needs to be covered latest on the course start.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The training is made of 4 modules:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Module 1: Intro + skin + strokes</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Module 2: Drawing eyebrows + pattern</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Module 3: Colorimetry</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Module 4: correction + removal<br><br><br>CONTENT<br><br>Difference between micro pigmentation and microblading Skin type and its relation with tattooing<br>Color wheel and how to choose the perfect color<br>Needle configurations</p>\n\n\n\n<p>How to achieve perfect hair strokes<br>Most common problems with healed strokes 7- Patterns<br>No tattoo technique<br>Eyebrows shape for every face<br>Correction and removal<br>Consultation<br>Hygiene and preparation<br>Aftercare<br><br><br><strong>Microblading + shading:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>3 days course&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  (with kit)</p>\n\n\n\n<p>3 days course&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  (without kit)</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Semi- Permanent (eyes + lips):<br><br></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>2 days course&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  (without kit)</p>\n\n\n\n<p>2 days course&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  + 800 –  extra, depending on the kit you want</p>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;<br><strong>LIP BLUSH INFORMATION TO BE CONFIRMED</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"microneedling\"><br><br>MICRONEEDLING</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><br><br>Academy – Program<br><br>Hairdressing<br><br>We offer a comprehensive portfolio of hairdressing courses in Pakistan designed to meet a variety of learning requirements in cutting, coloring, styling, and bridal hair up styles all completed with local &amp; international certificates.<br>From Beginner Hair Cutting Courses &amp; Hair Colouring Courses In Pakistan to the ultimate master courses.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our international trainers have great experience and expertise in the hair and beauty industry and have been working with many celebrities such as Lindsey Lohan, Nicole Scherzinger, Nadine Njeim, etc.</p>\n\n\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button aligncenter has-custom-font-size\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background\">Check Out Our Academy Courses Catalogue</a></div>\n</div>"
