      "html": "<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"our-aesthetic-program-includes-the-following-courses\">Our Aesthetic program includes the following courses:</h3>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"microdermabrasion-course\"><a href=\"/courses/microdermabrasion-course\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.nordicbtc.ae/courses/microdermabrasion-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MICRODERMABRASION COURSE</a></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"/courses/microdermabrasion-course\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"/images/library/Microderma-Planning.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3762\" srcset=\"/images/library/Microderma-Planning.jpg 500w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microderma-Planning-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microderma-Planning-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microderma-Planning-120x120.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"cosmetic-medical-chemical-peeling-skin-care-course\"><a href=\"/courses/cosmetic-medical-chemical-peeling-skincare-course\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.nordicbtc.ae/courses/cosmetic-medical-chemical-peeling-skincare-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">COSMETIC MEDICAL CHEMICAL PEELING &amp; SKIN CARE COURSE</a></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"/courses/cosmetic-medical-chemical-peeling-skincare-course\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"/images/library/Chemical-Peel.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3760\" srcset=\"/images/library/Chemical-Peel.jpg 500w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Chemical-Peel-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Chemical-Peel-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Chemical-Peel-120x120.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"mesotherapy-microneedling-course\"><a href=\"/courses/mesotherapy-microneedling-course\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.nordicbtc.ae/courses/mesotherapy-microneedling-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MESOTHERAPY / MICRONEEDLING COURSE</a></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"/courses/mesotherapy-microneedling-course\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"/images/library/Microneedling.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3761\" srcset=\"/images/library/Microneedling.jpg 500w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microneedling-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microneedling-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Microneedling-120x120.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"dermaplaning-course\"><a href=\"/courses/dermaplaning-course\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.nordicbtc.ae/courses/dermaplaning-course/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DERMAPLANING COURSE</a></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"/courses/dermaplaning-course\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"/images/library/Dermaplanning.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3759\" srcset=\"/images/library/Dermaplanning.jpeg 500w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Dermaplanning-300x300.jpeg 300w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Dermaplanning-150x150.jpeg 150w, https://www.nordicbtc.ae/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Dermaplanning-120x120.jpeg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p>Want to continue your medical education and enroll in an <strong>aesthetic course in Pakistan</strong>? At Crownora Barber Academy, we offer comprehensive and practical learning experiences in multiple areas. Our specialty includes aesthetics, hairdressing and beauty therapy.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Certified Aesthetic Treatment Experts – Professional Learning Experience</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You can enroll for masterclasses and gain valuable knowledge about the most effective aesthetic treatments for skin. We take your learning experience a step further by engaging you in live treatment sessions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>During your <strong>aesthetic course in Pakistan</strong>, you’ll observe certified professionals conducting treatments at Crownora Barber Academy using the latest medical equipment in a safe and sterilized environment. You can exchange ideas, enhance clinical skills, and gain scientific knowledge. Our primary aesthetic courses include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Dermaplaning Course</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Mesotherapy / Micro-Needling Course</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose Crownora Barber Academy for Aesthetic Courses in Pakistan?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Crownora Barber Academy is a certified and accredited training institute for individuals and groups. Our <strong>aesthetic courses in Pakistan</strong> include various training programs carefully designed and put forward by experienced beauticians.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Crownora Barber Academy was established with a reputation for serving gold-standard learning experiences to local and international students. Choose Crownora Barber Academy for an <strong>aesthetic course in Pakistan</strong> because:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Complete training to improve your aesthetic practice</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Courses offered throughout the year and online</li>\n\n\n\n<li>International and highly experienced experts to host masterclasses</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hands-on learning environment (live sessions)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Enroll in Our Aesthetic Course in Pakistan Today!</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Want to learn from top experts in the industry and improve your skills? Get in touch with the official representatives of Crownora Barber Academy and sign up for a masterclass.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Sign Up for an Aesthetic Course Now!</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button has-custom-font-size aligncenter\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\">Check Out Our Academy Courses Catalogue</a></div>\n</div>"
